Clashweave

Third-party credits

Mo' Bends (https://github.com/mobends/MoBends), MIT License.
The ideas of chasing a per-part target with a frame-rate independent exponential
filter, of procedural movement segments (walk, sprint, jump, sneak, ...) layered
on a body skeleton, and of cutting a model's boxes at a joint with each face's
texture recomputed from the face it was cut from are taken from Mo' Bends. The
formulas and the code in this repository are written for this project's skeleton
and conventions; no source from Mo' Bends is copied.
